cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Bilingual Political Attitude Classification (English & Bangla)"
abstract: >-
  A modular, reproducible research codebase for multilingual (English + Bangla)
  political attitude classification using negative, neutral, and positive
  text sentiment labels, comparing a TF-IDF linear
  baseline, a BiLSTM with attention, and a fine-tuned multilingual transformer,
  with bias/fairness auditing, explainability (LIME/SHAP/attention), and a
  FastAPI + Streamlit demo.
authors:
  - family-names: "Scube"
    given-names: "Team"
keywords:
  - political attitude classification
  - bilingual
  - sentiment analysis
  - natural language processing
  - political NLP
  - multilingual
  - Bangla
  - BERT
  - BiLSTM
  - explainable AI
  - algorithmic fairness
